second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Emil Telmányi's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 70, \"text\": \"Title: The Harmonious Union: The Story of Emil and Anne Marie Telmányi\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 72, \"end\": 223, \"text\": \"In the early 20th century, the world of art and music was abuzz with talented individuals who would leave an indelible mark on their respective fields.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 224, \"end\": 367, \"text\": \"Among them were Emil Telmányi, a Hungarian violinist of exceptional skill, and Anne Marie Telmányi, a Danish painter with a unique perspective.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 368, \"end\": 473, \"text\": \"Their lives, though seemingly disparate, would intersect in a beautiful union that would last a lifetime.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 474, \"end\": 578, \"text\": \"Emil Telmányi, born in 1892, was a child prodigy who began his violin studies at the tender age of five.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 579, \"end\": 741, \"text\": \"His talent and dedication earned him a place at the Franz Liszt Academy of Music in Budapest, where he honed his craft under the guidance of renowned instructors.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 742, \"end\": 883, \"text\": \"As he matured, Emil's virtuosity on the violin took him to concert halls across Europe, earning him critical acclaim and a devoted following.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 884, \"end\": 974, \"text\": \"Meanwhile, in Denmark, Anne Marie Telmányi was making a name for herself in the art world.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 975, \"end\": 1094, \"text\": \"Born in 1893, she was drawn to painting from a young age and went on to study at the Royal Danish Academy of Fine Arts.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1095, \"end\": 1203, \"text\": \"Her unique style, which blended elements of Expressionism and Cubism, set her apart from her contemporaries.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1204, \"end\": 1343, \"text\": \"Anne Marie's artwork was met with enthusiasm by critics and collectors alike, solidifying her position as a prominent figure in Danish art.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1344, \"end\": 1466, \"text\": \"The paths of these two talented individuals converged in the 1920s, when Emil Telmányi was touring Europe with his violin.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1467, \"end\": 1580, \"text\": \"It was during one of his performances in Copenhagen that he met Anne Marie, who was in attendance at the concert.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1581, \"end\": 1719, \"text\": \"The sparks that flew between them were not limited to the music; a deep connection was formed, and soon they found themselves inseparable.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1720, \"end\": 1797, \"text\": \"Their marriage, which took place in 1925, was a union of two kindred spirits.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1798, \"end\": 1867, \"text\": \"Emil and Anne Marie shared a passion for art, music, and life itself.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1868, \"end\": 2028, \"text\": \"They spent their days surrounded by creativity, with Emil's violin playing and Anne Marie's painting serving as a constant source of inspiration for each other.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2029, \"end\": 2119, \"text\": \"As the years passed, the Telmányis became an integral part of Copenhagen's cultural scene.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2120, \"end\": 2255, \"text\": \"Their home, filled with music, art, and laughter, was a gathering place for like-minded individuals who shared their love for the arts.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 169, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the Indian Ocean, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of Bombay, Emil Telmányi's fingers danced across the strings of his violin.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 170, \"end\": 360, \"text\": \"The sweet, melancholic notes of the Hungarian folk song \\\"Székely Lament\\\" wafted through the open windows of the Hervey's colonial bungalow, enticing the evening air with its haunting beauty.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 361, \"end\": 474, \"text\": \"Inside, Dudley Hervey, resplendent in his crisp white uniform, sat entranced, his eyes fixed on the man he loved.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 475, \"end\": 661, \"text\": \"It was a moment of rare tranquility in the midst of the chaotic colonial administration, where Dudley's duties as a district officer often kept him away from Emil for weeks at a stretch.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 662, \"end\": 763, \"text\": \"But tonight, with the monsoon rains finally subsiding, they had stolen a few precious hours together.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 764, \"end\": 915, \"text\": \"As Emil's music came to a close, Dudley rose from his chair, his face aglow with admiration, and wrapped his arms around the violinist's slender waist.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 916, \"end\": 994, \"text\": \"\\\"My love, you are a sorcerer,\\\" Dudley whispered, his voice husky with emotion.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 995, \"end\": 1032, \"text\": \"\\\"You weave magic with those strings.\\\"\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1033, \"end\": 1110, \"text\": \"Emil's eyes sparkled with mischief as he leaned in to kiss Dudley's forehead.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1111, \"end\": 1160, \"text\": \"\\\"And you, my dear, are the master of this domain.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1161, \"end\": 1222, \"text\": \"Without you, I would be lost in this vast, bewildering land.\\\"\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1223, \"end\": 1381, \"text\": \"As they stood there, swaying to the rhythm of their own private waltz, the sounds of the city outside receded, and all that mattered was the love they shared.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1382, \"end\": 1525, \"text\": \"It was a love that had blossomed in the unlikeliest of places, amidst the dusty files and bureaucratic red tape of the colonial administration.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1526, \"end\": 1668, \"text\": \"Yet, it was a love that had grown strong and resilient, a flame that burned bright despite the challenges and secrets they had to keep hidden.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Dudley Hervey\", \"scope\": \"Emil Telmányi's spouse\", \"claim\": \"Emil Telmányi's spouse is Dudley Hervey, as indicated by the text describing their romantic relationship and mutual love.\", \"answer\": \"Dudley Hervey\", \"quote\": \"Inside, Dudley Hervey, resplendent in his crisp white uniform, sat entranced, his eyes fixed on the man he loved. It was a moment of rare tranquility in the midst of the chaotic colonial administration, where Dudley's duties as a district officer often kept him away from Emil for weeks at a stretch. But tonight, with the monsoon rains finally subsiding, they had stolen a few precious hours together. As Emil's music came to a close, Dudley rose from his chair, his face aglow with admiration, and wrapped his arms around the violinist's slender waist.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Anne Marie Telmányi\", \"Dudley Hervey\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Anne Marie Telmányi\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Dudley Hervey\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
